  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "She tells Xing Xiang Zi that meeting him is her misfortune, that he offended Song clan, and that he should surrender rather than burden the Yu Lu blessed land invasion. Fang Yuan reads the rudeness as a righteous path attitude. In her impression Northern Plains Gu Immortals are rash and arrogant, so his mild reply startles her.",
      "chapters": [
        903
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_song_clan",
        "loc_yu_lu_blessed_land",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She is a skinny middle aged woman with an arrogant expression. She stands in the air with that same arrogance while working.",
      "chapters": [
        903
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Two streams of yellow and white vapor blow from her nose, race a circuit, and destroy up to a hundred hidden mortal Gu. The streams thin, then regain power when breathed out again. Fang Yuan takes this for an immortal killer move, far above the mortal methods he is using. Shark Demon had placed the most focus on her among the three invited helpers, as a person mainly cultivating wisdom path. Dong Fang Chang Fan’s wisdom path inheritance is more refined than hers.",
      "chapters": [
        904
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "yellow-white-vapor",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_mortal_gu",
        "char_shark_demon",
        "inh_dong_fang_wisdom_path_inheritance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside incomplete Profound Ice House, personal methods are obstructed. She offers to settle the remaining hidden Gu worms if Shark Demon gives her the Immortal Gu inside as compensation. He limits her to one. Black and white lights form a map-like ball of black, white, and grey that shows the battlefield. The immortal killer move is distinct map. She pinches hidden spots on the map and destroys those Gu from inside the house, then captures an Immortal Gu. Fang Yuan cannot match a wisdom path Gu Immortal of her level. Distinct map shows investigation and long ranged attack more than deduction. When eight doors labyrinth follows, she warns it traps rather than kills, explains the eight-by-eight door rumor, and says they can still retreat from the first area. Shark Demon’s group withdraws. She gained the biggest profit from the trip.",
      "chapters": [
        905
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hidden-gu-purge-and-capture",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_profound_ice_house",
        "sys_gu_worms",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Shark Demon later ranks her far above Fang Yuan in skill, notes she is a righteous path Gu Immortal who does not fit his group, and resents the appetite that took an Immortal Gu while his side got nothing.",
      "chapters": [
        906
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hidden-gu-purge-and-capture",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
